# Copy to .env (or just leave it — these values are already the real ones).
#
# These are the PUBLIC anon/publishable keys for the Supabase project. Row-level
# security is enabled on `reel_posts` and only permits SELECT, so they are safe
# to ship in client code and safe to commit. The PUBLIC_ prefix makes Astro
# inline them at build time, which is what Cloudflare Pages needs.
